       ffiieelldd__ssttaattuuss gets the current value.  The status flag is set to a  non‐
       zero value whenever the field changes.

       The  function  sseett__mmaaxx__ffiieelldd sets the maximum size for a dynamic field.
       An argument of 0 turns off any maximum size threshold for that field.

